# [DD-13b.W23.5] R-A (escalated by w233_report.md §3.2 / w234_report.md
# §3; manager ruling): the ONLY fixture whose `pattern-esc` block
# contains a REAL escape (`\n`), so the dump-value seam the two prior
# reports found at population ZERO has a population of one.
#
# Leg A's `pattern` column is the DECODED bytes (pcrec's one decoder,
# `pcrec_rxt_decode_escaped`); legs B and C report the text AS WRITTEN,
# quotes included, because decoding it would mean a second copy of the
# escape table in bash and a third in python. So this is the third
# instance of the dup_head_description/include SEAM shape (w233a_report
# .md §2's own naming): the three-leg VALUE comparison for a
# `pattern-esc` row is A-vs-(B==C), EXCLUDED BY DESIGN rather than a
# three-way agreement — see the check below.
pattern a+
m "aaa" 0 3
pattern-esc "a\nb"
m "a\nb" 0 3
